# Candidate Sourcing Agent — environment variables
#
# Email connects via OAuth (no key needed here). Your discovery engine and ATS usually need an API key.
# The agent-onboarding skill will prompt you to add whichever of these apply to the tools you chose.
# Add them under Settings → Secrets (preferred) or copy this file to .env and fill in.

# --- Discovery engine (pick the one you use) ---
# APOLLO_API_KEY=your-apollo-api-key
# Some internal sourcing tools (Juicebox, MetaView, etc.) use their own key:
# DISCOVERY_API_KEY=your-discovery-tool-api-key

# --- ATS (pick the one you use) ---
# ASHBY_API_KEY=your-ashby-api-key
# GREENHOUSE_API_KEY=your-greenhouse-harvest-api-key
# LEVER_API_KEY=your-lever-api-key
